          <div class="interactive-stack compact-activity" data-check-activity>
            <div class="sort-row"><p>Groups differ before the intervention and no adjustment or comparison is made.</p><select data-answer="internal"><option value="">Choose…</option><option value="credibility">Credibility</option><option value="reliability">Reliability</option><option value="internal">Internal validity</option><option value="transfer">Transferability</option></select></div>
            <div class="sort-row"><p>Two raters apply a scoring rubric inconsistently.</p><select data-answer="reliability"><option value="">Choose…</option><option value="transfer">Transferability</option><option value="internal">Internal validity</option><option value="credibility">Credibility</option><option value="reliability">Reliability</option></select></div>
            <div class="sort-row"><p>Interpretations are tested against contrary cases and supported with low-inference evidence.</p><select data-answer="credibility"><option value="">Choose…</option><option value="reliability">Reliability</option><option value="credibility">Credibility</option><option value="transfer">Transferability</option><option value="internal">Internal validity</option></select></div>
            <div class="sort-row"><p>The report richly describes the setting and participants so readers can judge contextual relevance.</p><select data-answer="transfer"><option value="">Choose…</option><option value="transfer">Transferability</option><option value="credibility">Credibility</option><option value="internal">Internal validity</option><option value="reliability">Reliability</option></select></div>
            <div class="activity-actions"><button type="button" data-check>Check matches</button><button type="button" data-clear>Clear</button><span class="activity-status" data-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
