            <div class="sort-row"><p>兩名評分者以不一致方式使用評分規準。</p><select data-answer="reliability"><option value="">請選擇⋯⋯</option><option value="transfer">可轉移性</option><option value="internal">內部效度</option><option value="credibility">可信性</option><option value="reliability">信度</option></select></div>
